        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745290/extras/8e30a2c4806afaef35eb4d28dabdc923.avif?t=1762450242\" width=1250 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Payphone is a short bite-sized experimental horror game from Kosumic Interactive Studio</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS-Style aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-Poly &amp; Low-Res inspired horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lonely and Oppressive atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Payphone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and use items.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745290/extras/5ad8b27044358c404c536c7811fa383f.poster.avif?t=1762450242\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745290/extras/5ad8b27044358c404c536c7811fa383f.webm?t=1762450242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745290/extras/5ad8b27044358c404c536c7811fa383f.mp4?t=1762450242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an investigator working in a near-bankrupt agency, however a case no-one would take landed on your desk. Disappearances of Ashfield Plains, each case is hauntingly similar, all their final phone calls were traced back to that specific payphone. Short on cash, you took the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Payphone is a bite-sized, first person horror experience inspired by low-poly retro aesthetic. Explore a forgotten stretch of road, swallowed by utter darkness and loneliness while slowly piecing together what might have happened, or rather, what caused the disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745290/extras/a9be477abc79ce09f7f323ac0517c175.poster.avif?t=1762450242\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745290/extras/a9be477abc79ce09f7f323ac0517c175.webm?t=1762450242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745290/extras/a9be477abc79ce09f7f323ac0517c175.mp4?t=1762450242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745290/extras/712069fffa378f0a1e4a0dbddc63d167.poster.avif?t=1762450242\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745290/extras/712069fffa378f0a1e4a0dbddc63d167.webm?t=1762450242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745290/extras/712069fffa378f0a1e4a0dbddc63d167.mp4?t=1762450242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745290/extras/8e30a2c4806afaef35eb4d28dabdc923.avif?t=1762450242\" width=1250 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Payphone is a short bite-sized experimental horror game from Kosumic Interactive Studio</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS-Style aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-Poly &amp; Low-Res inspired horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lonely and Oppressive atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Payphone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and use items.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745290/extras/5ad8b27044358c404c536c7811fa383f.poster.avif?t=1762450242\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745290/extras/5ad8b27044358c404c536c7811fa383f.webm?t=1762450242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745290/extras/5ad8b27044358c404c536c7811fa383f.mp4?t=1762450242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an investigator working in a near-bankrupt agency, however a case no-one would take landed on your desk. Disappearances of Ashfield Plains, each case is hauntingly similar, all their final phone calls were traced back to that specific payphone. Short on cash, you took the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Payphone is a bite-sized, first person horror experience inspired by low-poly retro aesthetic. Explore a forgotten stretch of road, swallowed by utter darkness and loneliness while slowly piecing together what might have happened, or rather, what caused the disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745290/extras/a9be477abc79ce09f7f323ac0517c175.poster.avif?t=1762450242\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745290/extras/a9be477abc79ce09f7f323ac0517c175.webm?t=1762450242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745290/extras/a9be477abc79ce09f7f323ac0517c175.mp4?t=1762450242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745290/extras/712069fffa378f0a1e4a0dbddc63d167.poster.avif?t=1762450242\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745290/extras/712069fffa378f0a1e4a0dbddc63d167.webm?t=1762450242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745290/extras/712069fffa378f0a1e4a0dbddc63d167.mp4?t=1762450242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
